TITLE Ba solution equilibration with mineral assemblage at 100C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    units mmol/kgw
    Ba 100
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc 0 10
    Rhodochrosite 0 10
    Sepiolite 0 10
    Sepiolite(d) 0 10
    Pb(OH)2 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -ph true
    -totals Ba Mg Si Mn Pb C(4)
    -equilibrium_phases Talc Rhodochrosite Sepiolite Sepiolite(d) Pb(OH)2
END
